@2111 = ~Fire Alchemy~
@2112 = ~Fire Alchemy:

This gift allows the Preacher of Flames to create one fire-related potion per day. Each potion requires 100 gp worth of ingredients.~
@21121 = ~Potion of the Inner Furnace~
@21122 = ~This potion is dangerous to drink and can even prove fatal. Its main attraction, however, is its secondary effect.

STATISTICS:

The drinker suffers 8d6 points of fire damage (a successful save vs. polymorph at -4 negates this damage), but gains 100% cold resistance for 4 rounds.~

@2113 = ~Rage of the Preacher~
@2114 = ~Rage of the Preacher:

A Preacher of Flames who has mastered fire can turn the rage within him into intense heat. By channeling his battle frenzy, he unleashes an explosion that incinerates everything nearby.
All creatures within 10 meters suffer 16d6 points of damage, halved on a successful save vs. spell. Creatures that fail this save must also save vs. death or suffer another 16d6 points of damage, for a total of 32d6 if both saves fail. Magic resistance offers no protection against this supernatural ability.
Channeling this rage exhausts the preacher. He must save vs. death or fall unconscious for 1d4 rounds.~

